<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Alignment Failure</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<h2><span lang="EN-GB">'Alignment Failure' warning message</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Occasionally, the alignment process fails with the warning message 'Alignment Failure'. This is rare if the system has been correctly prepared. Here are the most likely causes:</span></p>
<p><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">Possible causes of alignment failure:</span></b></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Localiser setup incorrect</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Planes captured in incorrect sequence</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Incorrect localiser probe diameter entered</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Localiser out of calibration</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Certified distances entered incorrectly</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Sensor calibration file does not match sensor ID/serial number</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Sensor ambient threshold set to incorrect figure</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Sensor laser power set incorrectly</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Sensor out of calibration</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Warning" id="P1"><span lang="EN-GB">If alignment fails repeatedly, contact your distributor for support.</span></p>
<h2 id="P1"><span lang="EN-GB">Alignments from Previous versions</span></h2>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-IP1">
<p id="P1" class="bullet">An alignment made with 3D Scanners v7 will not work in KUBE.</p>
</li>
</ul>
